==Important events==
{{spoilers}}
* {{adv|Red}} loses to {{adv|Deoxys}}.
* {{adv|Giovanni}} reveals that he intends to find his son.
* Giovanni captures Deoxys.
* {{adv|Green}}'s [[Blasty]] learns {{m|Hydro Cannon}}.
* {{adv|Mewtwo}} reappears and decides to fight [[Team Rocket]].
* Red and the others arrive at the [[Trainer Tower]].
* {{adv|Professor Oak}} and Green's parents are rescued.
* Mewtwo is bound by a special armor called M2 Bind. 
* It's revealed that the two gems acquired by Giovanni at the end of the {{MangaArc|Ruby & Sapphire|previous chapter}} have been used to simulate the [[Hoenn]] region's climate.
* {{adv|Yellow}} meets {{adv|Silver}} again, and he reveals that he is searching for where he came from.
* Professor Oak manages to complete the new [[Pokédex]]es.
* {{adv|Blue}} and Green's old Pokédexes are destroyed.

